# Conformance probe pack for `until:3 chars:ascii7` under `bit_order msb-lsb`
# (spec 0.22: the terminator is compared as `uint` reads each 7-bit code).
# Public. Bit order msb-lsb (spec 0.22): positions count from the high bit of
# each byte, a value is assembled from its first bit up. No kinds.
#
#   label  7-bit characters up to the code 3
format     conformance-long-mlsb-until
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb-lsb
field   probe.label  until:3  chars:ascii7
